%% UC-14 — Manage settings & language preference
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant B as Backend (usersRouter)
    participant M as MongoDB

    P->>F: Change language to German in Settings
    F->>F: LocaleProvider.setLocale('de')
    F->>B: PUT /api/v1/users/me {preferredLanguage: "de"}
    B->>M: findOneAndUpdate(users, {userId}, {$set: {preferredLanguage}}, {upsert: true})
    M-->>B: updated document
    B-->>F: 200 {preferredLanguage: "de"}
    F->>F: Rebuild UI with German locale
    F->>B: Subsequent reads use ?lang=de (see UC-04)
